      "title": "Encrypted connection between service endpoints",
      "description": "Service endpoints can be located in different subnets, different availability zones or regions in a cloud provider environment, in different clouds, or on-premises. Wherever they are located, communication between any two should be encrypted to ensure eavesdropping protection and message authenticity.",
